    <h2>Who this notice covers</h2>
    <p>This notice describes how information submitted through this website is handled. The controlling
      legal entity, registered address and contact point are pending corporate confirmation and will
      be stated here before publication.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>If you submit a freight enquiry, we receive the details you provide: your name, business email,
      company, optional phone number, and the shipment information needed to discuss a quotation.
      This website does not currently store submissions. Where online submission is not enabled, an
      enquiry is composed in your own email application and sent by you directly.</p>

    <h2>Why we use it</h2>
    <p>To respond to your enquiry and to discuss the shipment or service you asked about.</p>

    <h2>Retention and your rights</h2>
    <p>Retention periods, the service providers involved, and your rights of access, correction and
      deletion under applicable law are pending legal review and will be set out here before this
      notice is published.</p>

    <h2>Analytics and tracking</h2>
    <p>This website sets no analytics or advertising cookies. If that changes, this notice will be
      updated before any tracking is introduced.</p>
